WEBVTT

01:35.000 --> 01:37.780
Student Council Room

01:46.900 --> 01:50.790
This is the hidden camera video
I recorded of the incident.

01:57.970 --> 01:59.490
As you can see...

02:02.600 --> 02:06.510
Operation: Monopolize Glasses
Celeb was a total failure.

02:07.130 --> 02:09.440
So this is it?

02:12.500 --> 02:15.690
Student Council President
William Sato

02:17.160 --> 02:20.800
If it gets out that student council
funds were used for this,

02:20.800 --> 02:23.080
I'll be the one held responsible.

02:23.570 --> 02:26.580
M-My stomach...

02:29.370 --> 02:30.830
Here. Stomach medicine.

02:32.330 --> 02:33.400
Thanks.

02:35.450 --> 02:37.130
Hey, it's empty!

02:45.720 --> 02:50.720
Come, Glasses Wearers!
Your Glasses Will Change the World!

02:45.860 --> 02:47.780
Stomach pain!

02:51.350 --> 02:52.310
They're finished?!

02:52.780 --> 02:55.320
The X-Ray Glasses Mk. 37?!

02:56.820 --> 02:57.870
No...

02:58.810 --> 03:00.730
They appear to be a total failure.

03:00.730 --> 03:02.330
Then don't hand them to me!

03:02.490 --> 03:05.240
Th-This is kind of dangerous!

03:05.240 --> 03:07.440
There's smoke coming out of them!

03:07.440 --> 03:09.830
This is dangerous.

03:10.180 --> 03:12.460
Glasses Club. No...

03:13.020 --> 03:14.960
Soma Akira!

03:14.960 --> 03:17.760
Don't think I'll let this stand!

03:27.760 --> 03:29.450
That was close.

03:34.180 --> 03:37.040
A surprise attack?!

03:45.450 --> 03:46.610
This is it!

03:46.610 --> 03:47.630
Hima Council!

03:48.150 --> 03:51.620
This is for Lorenzo, this is for Maximilian,

03:51.890 --> 03:52.620
Watanabe

03:52.060 --> 03:53.960
this is for Toru.

03:53.020 --> 03:54.150
Takahashi

03:53.960 --> 03:56.880
Antonio, you prefer it weak, right?

03:54.150 --> 03:55.500
Suzuki

03:56.040 --> 03:56.870
Tanaka

03:57.380 --> 04:01.380
This is no time for a leisurely
cup of tea, Mr. President!

04:02.890 --> 04:04.310
Look at this!

04:05.530 --> 04:08.900
The Glasses Club is in violation of
student council regulations!

04:10.740 --> 04:12.730
The Glasses Club again?

04:17.660 --> 04:21.470
Announcement

04:17.660 --> 04:25.060
The Glasses Club is in violation of Student Council
regulations, which state, "All clubs not containing
at least five members will be dissolved." In order to
adhere to these guidelines, you must increase your
membership by the end of the day or your club will
be dissolved.

04:17.900 --> 04:22.280
"The Glasses Club is in violation of
Student Council regulations, which state,

04:22.280 --> 04:25.120
'All clubs not containing at least
five members will be dissolved.'

04:25.060 --> 04:31.910
This is a final decision not subject to change.
If you do not increase your membership, we
will take immediate action to have your club
dissolved.
- Student Council President, Sato William.

04:25.120 --> 04:27.960
In order to adhere to these guidelines,

04:27.960 --> 04:30.230
you must increase your membership
by the end of the day

04:30.230 --> 04:31.910
or your club will be dissolved."

04:32.140 --> 04:33.880
Dissolved?!

04:34.370 --> 04:36.100
Himaraya 3rd Technical
School Student Council

04:34.970 --> 04:39.210
Damn that Hima Council.
They've hit us where it hurts.

04:36.630 --> 04:39.540
Hima Council

04:39.710 --> 04:42.930
And we covered it so well when
we created the club, too.

04:43.360 --> 04:45.170
But, wait...

04:45.490 --> 04:52.190
Hachimine-senpai, the president,
Mitsuki, Minabe-senpai, and me.

04:52.600 --> 04:55.620
The Glasses Club <i>does</i>
have five members!

04:55.620 --> 04:58.770
No. Our Glasses Club has
only four members.

04:58.770 --> 05:01.100
Huh? But...

05:01.100 --> 05:02.440
It is because, Hayato...

05:03.080 --> 05:05.010
Your membership is only provisional!

05:05.930 --> 05:07.940
Provisional...

05:06.030 --> 05:07.460
Provisional?

05:08.540 --> 05:10.480
In other words, you mean...

05:10.480 --> 05:14.120
I'm still not counted as
a member of the club?

05:14.120 --> 05:15.480
That is correct.

05:15.970 --> 05:19.710
Provisional

05:18.410 --> 05:19.720
In that case...

05:19.720 --> 05:25.220
Just make me a new club member now!
That would solve everything, right?

05:25.760 --> 05:27.790
The deadline is tomorrow morning.

05:28.240 --> 05:31.220
We'll need to attract a new
member sometime today.

05:31.220 --> 05:32.210
President!

05:34.100 --> 05:37.180
Is it really because of my fake glasses?

05:37.980 --> 05:45.780
Provisional

05:37.990 --> 05:39.640
By the way, where's Yukiya?

05:39.640 --> 05:42.660
Yukiya-senpai has been in the
club room since yesterday

05:42.660 --> 05:45.480
working on the X-Ray Glasses Mk. 38...

05:47.990 --> 05:51.060
even though he just failed with the Mk. 37.

05:52.760 --> 05:56.230
Yukiya-senpai never seems to lose heart.

05:57.000 --> 05:57.990
Glasses.

06:01.900 --> 06:05.520
<i>Damn you, Glasses Club.
I know I've got you this time.</i>

06:05.520 --> 06:07.010
Morning, 3rd.

06:07.010 --> 06:08.230
Hey, 3rd.

06:08.230 --> 06:10.680
3rd! You're here early today.

06:14.280 --> 06:15.580
Suzuki Kazuo.

06:15.580 --> 06:16.530
Here.

06:16.530 --> 06:17.790
Suzuki Shuji.

06:17.790 --> 06:18.520
Here.

06:18.940 --> 06:20.410
Suzuki Toru.

06:20.410 --> 06:21.270
Here!

06:21.900 --> 06:23.350
Soma Akira.

06:23.840 --> 06:24.810
Soma—

06:24.810 --> 06:25.650
Wait!

06:26.290 --> 06:28.360
In the nick of time, safe!

06:28.360 --> 06:31.290
I made it with time to spare!

06:31.430 --> 06:34.540
Time to spare? You're out by a mile!

06:35.300 --> 06:38.540
Soma. Come by the faculty office later.

06:39.220 --> 06:40.340
Right.

06:41.040 --> 06:42.040
Glasses.

06:47.240 --> 06:49.060
Hey, Glasses Club!

06:49.290 --> 06:51.420
No, Soma Akira!

06:51.420 --> 06:53.300
You're finished this time!

06:54.290 --> 06:55.440
Hey!

06:59.660 --> 07:00.990
Oh, hey, it's 3rd.

07:00.990 --> 07:03.310
Don't call me 3rd!

07:03.690 --> 07:07.570
I will never forget that first day of school!

07:07.630 --> 07:10.610
Suzuki

07:07.930 --> 07:10.720
You said, "It's too hard to tell
the three Suzukis apart."

07:10.720 --> 07:15.150
So you numbered us by
our order on the class roll!

07:15.700 --> 07:19.300
And then, just because my name
happened to be third alphabetically,

07:19.300 --> 07:22.610
you gave me the nickname "3rd"!

07:22.610 --> 07:27.030
Because of that, ever since then,
everyone in class has called me 3rd,

07:27.030 --> 07:30.220
and I'm always compared
to the other two Suzukis!

07:30.220 --> 07:32.960
Then somehow, on the finals,

07:32.960 --> 07:35.660
I ended up placing 3rd out of the Suzukis!

07:35.660 --> 07:39.360
I place 3rd in foot races!
I'm even 3rd in height!

07:39.360 --> 07:42.540
It's not due to any lack
of effort on my part.

07:42.540 --> 07:47.370
It's because you placed a curse on me!
The curse of the Glasses Club!

07:47.480 --> 07:50.050
That's why I will see that the Glasses Club...

07:50.720 --> 07:51.990
Hey, he's gone!

07:51.990 --> 07:53.240
Glasses Club!

08:14.320 --> 08:18.280
I hold no particular enmity
towards the Glasses Club.

08:19.480 --> 08:21.720
But because of them,

08:21.720 --> 08:25.060
the people of the town speak of
Himaraya 3rd Technical High School

08:25.060 --> 08:26.920
like it's a pack of fools.

08:27.480 --> 08:29.940
As Student Council President, I...

08:31.450 --> 08:33.270
I cannot accept that.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.280
Mr. President.

08:36.960 --> 08:38.910
You said all that out loud.

08:41.210 --> 08:42.430
Oh no.

08:42.430 --> 08:46.920
My bad habit of speaking my inner
monologue out loud struck again...

08:46.920 --> 08:48.920
Faculty Office

08:47.940 --> 08:50.840
Well? What do you intend to do?

08:50.840 --> 08:51.920
About what?

08:52.060 --> 08:54.030
About that notice.

08:55.370 --> 08:56.900
Does it worry you?

08:56.900 --> 08:58.930
I am your advisor, after all.

08:59.270 --> 09:02.060
Well, whatever happens,

09:02.580 --> 09:04.460
I will protect the Glasses Club.

09:14.440 --> 09:15.440
Glasses!

09:17.440 --> 09:22.330
No glasses. No glasses.
No glasses. Glasses!

09:22.610 --> 09:25.920
Come to the Glasses Club!
You too! And you too!

09:25.920 --> 09:28.020
Your glasses will change the world!!

09:25.920 --> 09:28.920
Glasses Club

09:36.980 --> 09:38.180
Glasses...

09:38.180 --> 09:42.290
Hey, wanna join the
Glasses Club? You too!

09:44.300 --> 09:48.060
Hey, you! You got some nice glasses there!

09:48.060 --> 09:49.740
Wanna join the Glasses Club?

09:49.740 --> 09:50.690
Um, but...

09:50.900 --> 09:54.530
The president's really nice and
the senpai are really funny.

09:54.530 --> 09:56.610
It's tons of fun!

09:56.610 --> 09:58.060
But I...

09:58.060 --> 10:01.330
If you don't join, you'll definitely regret it!

10:01.470 --> 10:03.960
But I wear fake glasses.

10:02.390 --> 10:03.960
Fake Glasses

10:04.440 --> 10:08.650
That's fine, that's fine! Even if you
wear fake glasses, you can still jo—

10:09.580 --> 10:11.780
You can't join.

10:12.770 --> 10:15.970
Oh, sorry. Never mind, then.

10:19.140 --> 10:20.730
Glasses!

10:31.700 --> 10:36.370
"Come, glasses wearers," huh?

10:37.380 --> 10:39.740
Glasses Club

10:37.380 --> 10:39.740
Come, glasses wearers!

10:45.740 --> 10:48.370
Glasses Club

10:53.140 --> 10:54.260
Soma?!

10:54.260 --> 10:55.460
Hey, 3rd.

10:55.460 --> 10:57.130
Don't call me 3rd!

10:57.730 --> 10:59.630
Is there something you need from our club?

11:00.070 --> 11:03.050
Soma, are you the Glasses Club president?

11:03.050 --> 11:04.250
That's right.

11:06.820 --> 11:08.640
So, what did you need?

11:09.390 --> 11:10.500
3rd?

11:15.380 --> 11:17.780
No, nothing.

11:16.650 --> 11:19.800
Club Application
Suzuki Toru

11:25.170 --> 11:30.170
Oh, yay! None of the students
has gotten a single flyer, eh?

11:30.170 --> 11:33.960
The Glasses Club shall
henceforth fall into oblivion!

11:33.960 --> 11:38.640
To the travelers that pass by,
they'll be naught but scenery!

11:40.750 --> 11:46.440
Even if they start taking applications now,
no one will ever join their stupid club!

12:00.960 --> 12:04.510
New Member Recruitment

12:07.940 --> 12:11.500
No one's coming, I guess.

12:12.330 --> 12:16.980
By the way, Yukiya, you didn't show
up for any classes today, did you?

12:17.490 --> 12:19.140
Take a rest.

12:19.140 --> 12:21.970
You'll make yourself sick, working so hard.

12:30.700 --> 12:31.770
That's...

12:32.300 --> 12:34.780
The X-Ray Glasses Mk. 38!

12:36.500 --> 12:38.180
He finished them?

12:49.050 --> 12:50.050
What is

12:51.510 --> 12:53.210
this sensation?

12:54.220 --> 13:03.400
Roaaaaar

12:54.670 --> 12:57.350
This urge welling up from
the depths of my body!

12:57.700 --> 13:00.100
This irrepressible feeling!

13:03.310 --> 13:05.490
I want to say exactly what I think!

13:06.320 --> 13:07.520
Glasses.

13:17.740 --> 13:23.240
Roar

13:20.680 --> 13:22.850
Oh, Soma-kun.

13:23.500 --> 13:25.630
We finished handing out all the flyers.

13:25.630 --> 13:28.400
How many applicants did you get?

13:28.650 --> 13:30.330
How many, you ask?

13:31.010 --> 13:34.320
Do you people really think
you can attract applicants

13:34.320 --> 13:37.420
just by handing out flyers?! To be exact!

13:37.420 --> 13:38.800
To be exact?

13:37.750 --> 13:40.670
Exact?

13:38.800 --> 13:40.660
Is that some regional phrase you picked up?

13:41.050 --> 13:43.220
The glasses wearers of this school

13:43.220 --> 13:47.420
aren't like housewives flocking to a bargain
sale in a supermarket, to be exact!

13:47.670 --> 13:49.420
Only those who love glasses
with all their hearts,

13:49.420 --> 13:52.770
who respect glasses,
are true glasses wearers!

13:52.770 --> 13:54.940
The reason we have zero club applicants

13:55.330 --> 13:59.410
is because your Glasses Love
is insufficient, to be exact!

13:58.500 --> 14:01.610
Glasses LOVE

14:02.170 --> 14:03.610
That's not true!

14:03.880 --> 14:06.110
I may wear fake glasses,

14:06.110 --> 14:09.200
but my love for glasses is equal
to anyone else's in this club!

14:09.720 --> 14:13.160
I beg you! Please, make me
an official club member!

14:13.290 --> 14:14.370
I refuse!

14:16.090 --> 14:18.130
All right. Listen to me.

14:18.820 --> 14:21.680
Our Glasses Club has four members,

14:21.680 --> 14:24.540
but Hayato, you are our only
provisional member!

14:24.960 --> 14:28.990
More special than #1,
you are the <i>only one</i>!

14:28.990 --> 14:29.890
To be exact!

14:30.180 --> 14:33.730
In the end, that means he
still doesn't acknowledge him.

14:33.730 --> 14:37.520
Also, don't you think that
"to be exact" was a bit forced?

14:37.520 --> 14:40.140
It did seem like he forgot
about it halfway through.

14:40.810 --> 14:43.140
A special "only one"...

14:44.940 --> 14:46.740
Oh, he looks pretty moved.

14:46.740 --> 14:49.150
He totally ignored the "to be exact"?

14:49.480 --> 14:51.150
Oh, Soma-senpai.

14:51.560 --> 14:53.010
Where are you going?

14:53.770 --> 14:56.660
The student council room, to be exact.

14:58.580 --> 14:59.570
They're gone.

15:01.340 --> 15:02.500
Yukiya-senpai!

15:02.500 --> 15:05.300
The president's acting really weird!

15:05.300 --> 15:06.910
His eyes turned red,

15:06.910 --> 15:10.180
and he's going to the student council
room saying exactly what he thinks.

15:10.380 --> 15:11.850
Exactly what he thinks...

15:13.830 --> 15:15.450
That means Akira is...

15:15.810 --> 15:24.940
Don't run in the halls!

15:16.800 --> 15:18.460
X-Act Glasses?!

15:18.460 --> 15:21.520
Yes. They're a failed set of X-Ray Glasses.

15:21.760 --> 15:23.160
X-Act Glasses!

15:23.160 --> 15:24.940
Akira must have put them on.

15:24.940 --> 15:27.750
But what are X-Act Glasses?

15:27.750 --> 15:32.410
When you put them on,
you don't mince words.

15:32.410 --> 15:34.700
You say exactly what you
think about a person.

15:32.590 --> 15:34.700
Say exactly what you think.

15:34.700 --> 15:38.700
Wow, what mysterious glasses.

15:38.700 --> 15:41.100
If Soma-senpai says exactly what he thinks,

15:41.100 --> 15:42.840
and makes the student
council president mad,

15:42.840 --> 15:45.420
they'll dissolve the Glasses Club for sure!

15:45.420 --> 15:47.720
We must stop Akira at all costs!

15:48.540 --> 15:51.550
Excuse me! To be exact!

15:48.980 --> 15:51.550
Exact!

15:57.480 --> 16:02.020
Hey! Coming in without
knocking is bad manners!

16:02.350 --> 16:05.730
Be quiet! You need to study
more Japanese, to be exact!

16:02.350 --> 16:05.730
Exact!

16:06.040 --> 16:07.280
What?!

16:07.280 --> 16:11.600
Your turn has not yet come.
Exit the stage at once!

16:11.900 --> 16:17.610
Exact!

16:12.110 --> 16:17.610
Shut up, you wannabe third-rate
ham actor! To be exact.

16:17.930 --> 16:20.830
Exact? That's new.

16:21.150 --> 16:27.200
Wait, Soma! As long as I'm alive,
you won't lay one finger on the presid—

16:27.200 --> 16:28.340
He's not even listening!

16:31.690 --> 16:34.050
Mr. President, I have...

16:34.420 --> 16:36.220
things to say to you, to be exact.

16:36.220 --> 16:37.220
Akira!

16:38.220 --> 16:40.520
Wait! Don't ignore me!

16:56.410 --> 16:57.320
Exact?

16:58.940 --> 17:01.120
The X-Act Glasses hit Tony!

17:01.120 --> 17:03.330
That was a close one!

17:06.410 --> 17:09.340
Hey! Hayato! C'mon!

17:12.000 --> 17:14.370
Is he a friend of yours?

17:14.370 --> 17:16.630
You're in the same class as us, aren't you?

17:16.630 --> 17:18.900
Whatcha doin'? You're no fun, to be exact!

17:18.900 --> 17:22.480
How about dancing the
samba rhythm with me?

17:23.090 --> 17:26.910
What does "exact" mean, to be exact?
Doesn't matter, to be exact!

17:26.910 --> 17:30.730
Let's all dance! Happy, happy! Exact, exact!

17:30.920 --> 17:35.250
Those are the glasses that make you say
exactly what you think of people.

17:35.250 --> 17:39.370
Tony, is this what you really think of me?

17:39.370 --> 17:40.450
C'mon!

17:41.330 --> 17:42.450
President.

17:46.110 --> 17:48.200
At our entrance ceremony...

17:49.520 --> 17:52.200
When I saw you standing at
the podium in your glasses...

17:52.800 --> 17:55.350
I felt that, with a glasses wearer
standing at the top,

17:55.350 --> 18:00.020
I could rest easy and enjoy
my youth at this school.

18:00.680 --> 18:02.200
However!

18:02.200 --> 18:04.010
The reality was otherwise!

18:04.010 --> 18:08.720
You only wear glasses when reading
or conducting school business!

18:08.970 --> 18:11.300
You're a Sometimes Glasses Wearer!

18:09.290 --> 18:11.210
Sometimes Glasses Wearer

18:14.730 --> 18:17.360
I would have preferred it if
you'd worn no glasses at all!

18:19.340 --> 18:23.030
That way, I would have never
gotten my hopes up!

18:23.470 --> 18:25.120
To be perfectly frank,

18:25.530 --> 18:27.330
I felt betrayed!

18:31.580 --> 18:34.350
Even though he took off
the X-Act Glasses...

18:34.350 --> 18:37.270
He's still saying exactly what he thinks.

18:37.270 --> 18:39.390
That's just part of his character.

18:39.640 --> 18:43.050
At times you wear glasses.
At other times, no glasses.

18:43.050 --> 18:45.390
Unable to choose between these states,

18:45.760 --> 18:47.840
you will be unable to make
decisions when it counts.

18:47.840 --> 18:49.780
You are a half-baked person!

18:52.680 --> 18:55.360
S-Stomach pain!

18:54.040 --> 18:57.030
Stomach pain!

19:04.660 --> 19:05.680
Mr. President!

19:05.680 --> 19:08.650
The rose has been plucked!

19:09.970 --> 19:11.040
Don't move.

19:11.040 --> 19:14.220
If you come one step closer, I will drop
this stomach medicine out the window!

19:14.650 --> 19:18.340
Th-This is not hostage-taking,
but object-taking!

19:18.340 --> 19:23.040
To obey or not to obey!
That is the question!

19:23.340 --> 19:25.360
How did it come to this?

19:25.360 --> 19:28.310
I didn't expect this at all.

19:28.460 --> 19:31.810
How about a trade,
Student Council President?

19:32.330 --> 19:34.480
If you want me to return
this stomach medicine,

19:34.480 --> 19:36.320
you must promise to make
a special Hima Council rule

19:36.320 --> 19:38.780
to ensure the continuance
of the Glasses Club!

19:40.700 --> 19:42.230
<i>How enthralling.</i>

19:46.030 --> 19:47.740
Harder! Harder!

19:47.940 --> 19:49.760
Harder! Harder! Harder!

19:50.000 --> 19:51.560
O-Okay...

19:52.300 --> 19:57.260
Fool! That stomach medicine can
be bought at any drug store!

19:58.220 --> 20:04.430
Nay! 'Tis a special wonder drug, as
difficult to acquire as a mermaid's tear!

20:04.430 --> 20:11.260
That medicine alone can bring relief
to the president's silk-like stomach lining!

20:14.180 --> 20:17.530
It's very rare. It takes two weeks
to arrive after you place an order.

20:18.670 --> 20:21.580
Do as he says...

20:21.580 --> 20:22.530
Huh?

20:22.530 --> 20:25.570
Do as he...

20:25.570 --> 20:26.770
Huh?

20:36.120 --> 20:38.800
The President says to give in
to their demands!

20:38.800 --> 20:40.010
What?!

20:43.210 --> 20:44.340
Damn you!

20:45.320 --> 20:47.540
Negotiations successful, eh?

20:54.960 --> 20:56.810
Okay! Let's withdraw!

20:56.810 --> 20:57.680
Okay!

20:57.680 --> 20:58.380
Okay!

20:58.380 --> 20:59.210
Yeah.

20:59.210 --> 21:00.240
Hayato!

21:01.950 --> 21:04.600
How long do you intend
to dance? Come on!

21:06.400 --> 21:07.700
Hey, Hayato!

21:08.500 --> 21:10.500
We'll go all night, to be exa—

21:10.500 --> 21:12.700
You can keep the glasses.

21:12.800 --> 21:16.190
But they'll self-destruct in three seconds.

21:16.190 --> 21:19.890
Wait, Glasses Club!
We aren't done talking ye—

21:27.520 --> 21:30.470
Glasses Club, you will pay!

21:34.730 --> 21:38.450
Looks like my stomach pain
won't be going away anytime soon.

23:11.700 --> 23:13.460
Everyone! Rent me your ears!

23:13.460 --> 23:15.920
We of the Himaraya 3rd Technical High
School Student Council are...

23:15.920 --> 23:17.520
...the morning dew that forms so that

23:17.520 --> 23:18.800
President William may blossom in radiance!

23:18.800 --> 23:20.650
One for all! All for one!

23:20.650 --> 23:22.210
Everything we do is for the
Student Council President!

23:22.210 --> 23:24.500
You heard them. How do you feel, Will?

23:24.500 --> 23:25.730
Stomach pain!

23:31.040 --> 23:33.730
Round Titanium. Tomorrow's horoscope:

23:34.250 --> 23:39.010
They say a single teabag can make
tea for up to seven people.
